
  Patronus (Gentoo-based firewall live / installer)
  --------------------------------------------------
  Install to disk : patronus-install            (interactive TUI)
                    patronus-install --config answers.toml --yes
  Web UI          : https://<this-ip>:8443     user: admin
                    password: cat /var/lib/patronus/initial-admin-password
  Console login   : root / patronus  (change it!)
  Wi-Fi           : iwctl   (then: station wlan0 connect <ssid>)

